en:
To finish the evil spirit off.
He drove the box cutter into his own throat, and at last he destroyed the evil spirit.
Cutting his throat with the box cutter over and over and over again.{p}

"Are you okay? Come on, snap out of it."
I don't know how much time had passed.
I slowly opened my eyes.{p}

I see.
You're afraid...?
You're afraid because you have something to feel guilty about.{p}

Iwashita's body began to glow blue.
What?
What was happening?{p}
